Package: iQualityR.spc
Title: Statistical Process Control Charts for iQualityR
Version: 0.6.0
Description: Provides comprehensive statistical process control (SPC) tools
  aligned with Minitab's Stat > Control Charts menu, including Shewhart
  variables charts (Xbar-R, Xbar-S, I-MR), attributes charts (P, NP, U, C,
  Laney P' and U'), time-weighted charts (EWMA, CUSUM, MA), multivariate
  charts (Hotelling T2, MEWMA), rare-event charts (G, T), and Nelson rules
  detection. Version 0.2 adds statistical enhancement charts: adaptive
  rolling-window chart, ARIMA residual chart, adaptive EWMA, change-point
  detection, KDE nonparametric chart, and T2+MEWMA hybrid. Version 0.6 adds
  AI/ML enhancement charts: LSTM anomaly detection, Autoencoder, Isolation
  Forest, BOCPD (Bayesian Online Change Point Detection), and SHAP
  attribution with soft dependencies on keras/isotree/fastshap. Built on
  top of the iQualityR.core, iQualityR.stat, and iQualityR.plot subpackages.
